ds),'starts',set(starts),'rates',rates,'channels',mono)\""}], "aggregatedOutput": "max grid error sec 9.931973181664944e-07 max end diff 0.0029030158730165567 starts {np.float64(0.0)} rates {44100} channels {1}\r\n", "exitCode": 0, "durationMs": 2780}}
