{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "01a08154-4c27-7551-9cfa-e8e7d2bcf73a", "turn_id": "01a0efd4-365e-7141-8747-ea98e8d77c19", "item_id": "rs_06f6aa8593d2a892016abc6060d3f087d2b1f090f8b25c8058", "rollout_ordinal": 1390, "created_at_ms": 1790730337603, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1390, "started_at_ms": 1790730337603, "completed_at_ms": 1790730338005}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "rs_06f6aa8593d2a892016abc6060d3f087d2b1f090f8b25c8058", "summary": ["**Testing periodicity-gap rescue**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "01a08154-4c27-7551-9cfa-e8e7d2bcf73a", "turn_id": "01a0efd4-365e-7141-8747-ea98e8d77c19", "item_id": "msg_06f6aa8593d2a892016abc606141c887d2853b5f03f615f3c9", "rollout_ordinal": 1392, "created_at_ms": 1790730338030, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1392, "started_at_ms": 1790730338030, "completed_at_ms": 1790730340274}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "msg_06f6aa8593d2a892016abc606141c887d2853b5f03f615f3c9", "text": "Las primeras variantes muestran un problema: bajar el umbral o permitir continuidad por sí solos aumenta demasiado las falsas notas, especialmente con música. No las integraré así. Voy a probar una recuperación más selectiva de huecos breves y combinarla con el filtro de energía, usando todavía solo la parte de calibración.\n", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
